SUMMARY:SF’s Unique New Theatrical Circus “In/Decision” (2026)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T213000
DTSTAMP:20261103T193658Z
UID:funcheap-1645713@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Unique New Theatrical Circus “In/Decision” (Novembe
 r 6-7)\nTicketful / In/Decision\nFrom the producers of Memoir comes a uniq
 ue new theatrical circus experience.\nIn/Decision is an exploration of the
  moments that define us\, the leaps we take\, the risks we avoid\, the pat
 hs we choose without knowing where they lead. Through a seamless weaving o
 f breathtaking aerials\, acrobatics and storytelling\, this original produ
 ction invites audiences into the fragile space between choice and conseque
 nce.\nNormally $30-$40\, you can Get Complimentary Tickets to In/Decision 
 for November 6-7 if you are a member of Ticketful.\nEach act balances on t
 he edge of possibility: releasing the bar\, shifting weight\, moving forwa
 rd\, or taking a step back. A character speaks\, or stays silent. In these
  suspended moments\, worlds are made and unmade.\nPoetic\, visceral\, and 
 deeply human\, In/Decision asks: Are we guided by destiny\, or do we build
  it step by step? Come join us\, and decide.\nIn/Decision\nNovember 6-7\, 
 2026\n– Ticketful Comp Ticket Promotion Dates\nGreat Star Theater\, 636 
 Jackson St. SF (Chinatown)\n5 Credits for Tickets ($20 Ticketful membershi
 p gets you 10 credits a month) – Otherwise tickets are $30-$40\nShowtime
 s\n\nFriday\, November 6\, 2026 – 7:30 pm\nSaturday\, November 7\, 2026 
 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday – November 7\, 2026 – 7:30 pm\n\nDoors open 60 m
 inutes before showtime. No intermission. Seating is first-come\, first-ser
 ved\; Arrive early to choose your favorite seats!\nTicketful is a membersh
 ip for live events i...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://ticketful.app/app/ev
 ents?venueId=9fa3c2e2-e28f-49b1-8070-1e41ce581c90\nDetails: https://sf.fun
 cheap.com/sfs-unique-new-theatrical-circus-in-decision-2026/\nSource: Func
 heap SF
