DESCRIPTION:On Friday\, November 13\, from 5–8 pm\, Fulton Plaza will co
 me alive beneath the dazzling SPECTRA lights for the holiday season’s Pe
 rforming Arts Showcase\, a celebration bringing together some of downtown
 ’s most exciting performing arts organizations for one unforgettable eve
 ning.\n\nGuests will be treated to a dynamic lineup of live performances t
 o choreographed Illuminate lighting. Expect short works from the San Franc
 isco Opera\, San Francisco Ballet\, San Francisco Conservatory of Music\, 
 the African American Shakespeare Company\, RAWdance\, and more. From power
 ful voices and sweeping orchestral music to captivating movement and theat
 rical performances\, the showcase offers a little bit of everything — an
 d is a memorable way to launch the holiday season.\n\nThis event is free\,
  RSVP here.\n\nThe event will also feature a post-show reception with an o
 pportunity to mingle with the performing arts organizations\, ticket sales
 \, ticket raffles from the SF Symphony and Orpheum Theatre\, and bites and
