DESCRIPTION:Golden Gate Park “Singing in the Park” Community Party (SF
 )\nMcKenna Troy\nMake new friends and beautiful\, fun music: join us for f
 ree monthly community singing in the park!\n\nWe meet the Second Saturday 
 of every month @10:30am and will always have the pink blanket above so you
  can find us. The community sing is super kid\, adult and pet friendly. Th
 e music will be very easy (all skill levels welcome) and we’ll learn it 
 all together at the park. Listeners are also welcome\n\n10:30-10:40: Chat 
 and get to know new faces!10:45-11:00: Mini fun singing lesson11:00-11:30:
  Learn songs and sing together11:30* afterwards people are welcome to walk
  and grab pastries/coffee together from Arizmendi.\n\nUpcoming Golden Gate
  Park “Singing in the Park” Community Party (SF) Events\nSat 10/10 Gol
 den Gate Park “Singing in the Park” Community Party (SF)Sat 11/14 Gold
 en Gate Park “Singing in the Park” Community Party (SF)Sat 12/12 Golde
 n Gate Park “Singing in the Park” Community Party (SF)Disclaimer: Plea
 se double check event information with the event organizer as events can b
 e canceled\, details can change after they are added to our calendar\, and
  errors do occur.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/share/1B4nL
 LCf3L/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/golden-gate-park-singing-in-the-p
 ark-community-party-sf-21/\nSource: Funcheap SF
