CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerSaturday Write Fever: Insta-Pl
 ays Written & Performed | SF\nCC0 Creative Commons\nEvery second Saturday 
 of the month\, EXIT Theatre invites writers\, actors\, directors\, theater
  creators and theater audiences alike to a free evening of quick script-ma
 king and flash-fried performance.\nJoin in for:\n\n8:30 pm: Mixer\n9 pm: W
 riting sprint where writers have 30 minutes to generate original monologue
 s based around that night’s pre-generated prompts\n9:30 pm: Performance 
 of the work on stage in the café for an on-the-spot\, one-night-only inst
 ant festival\n\nThey cast actors from the crowd (no experience necessary)\
 , so come join in the communal creativity\, either as a writer\, performer
 \, or audience member. There’s no need for reservations\, though get the
 re early to get your name on the writer list which caps at 16.\n\nAdmissio
 n to this event is free and the café open and staffed during the event\, 
 so you can purchase drinks and snacks all night long.\n– Updated 6/26/19
  – Event info last checked via website\n\nUpcoming Saturday Write Fever:
  Insta-Plays Written & Performed | SF Events\nSat 10/10 Saturday Write Fev
 er: Insta-Plays Written & Performed | SFSat 11/14 Saturday Write Fever: In
 sta-Plays Written & Performed | SFSat 12/12 Saturday Write Fever: Insta-Pl
 ays Written & Performed | SFDisclaimer: Please double check event informat
 ion with the event organizer as events can be canceled\, details can chang
 e after they are added to our calendar\, and errors do occur.\n\nFree\n\nT
 ickets: http://sftheaterpub.wordpress.com/saturday-write-fever/\nDetails: 
 https://sf.funcheap.com/saturday-write-fever-insta-plays-written-performed
 -sf-145/\nSource: Funcheap SF
