BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Prokofiev’s “Romeo & Juliet” w/ the SF Symphony (Nov. 13–1
 5)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T170000
DTSTAMP:20261110T072652Z
UID:funcheap-1646668@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Theater Performance
DESCRIPTION:Prokofiev’s “Romeo & Juliet” w/ the SF Symphony (Nov. 13
 –15)\nSF Symphony\nProkofiev’s ballet music for Romeo and Juliet is ev
 ery bit as singular as the Shakespeare tragedy that inspired it: Savage an
 d sensual\, tragic and comic\, it conveys all the passion of the play and 
 loses none of its ambiguity. Debuting French conductor Marie Jacquot leads
  the Orchestra in the first SF Symphony performances of Andromède\, by he
 r underrated fellow countrywoman Augusta Holmès.\nThe symphonic poem infu
 ses ancient Greek myth with Wagnerian grandeur. Inspired by the music of e
 arly Christianity\, Ottorino Respighi pulls off medieval plainsong with 20
 th-century pizzazz in his spellbinding Concerto gregoriano. Japanese violi
 nist Sayaka Shoji summons up all of its enormous expressive power.\nProkof
 iev’s Romeo and Juliet\nFriday-Sunday\, November 13-15\nDavies Symphony 
 Hall\, 201 Van Ness Ave. SF\nGet Tickets – Tickets start at $30 – Orch
 estra seats start at just $69!\nSchedule:\n\nFriday\, November 13 – 7:30
 pm\nSaturday\, November 14 – 7:30pm\nSunday\, November 15 – 2pm\n\nArt
 ists\n\nMarie Jacquot – Conductor\nSayaka Shoji – Violin\nSan Francisc
 o Symphony\n\nProgram\n\nAugusta Holmès – Andromède – First San Fran
 cisco Symphony Performances\nOttorino Respighi – Concerto gregoriano\nSe
 rgei Prokofiev – Selections from Romeo and Juliet\nProgram Book\n\nConce
 rt Extras\nAn Inside Music Talk with members of the SF Symphony will be pr
 esented on stage one hour before each concert. Free to all ticketholders.\
 nInside Music Video Talk with Jenn...\n\n$30.00\n\nTickets: https://www.sf
 symphony.org/Buy-Tickets/2026-27/Romeo-and-Juliet\nDetails: https://sf.fun
 cheap.com/prokofievs-romeo-juliet-w-the-sf-symphony-nov-13-15-3/\nSource: 
 Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/349830
 -26_PMAX_RomeoJuliet_1-1200x628-1-e1794278364269.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261110T072652Z
LOCATION:Davies Symphony Hall\, 201 Van Ness Ave\, San Francisco\, CA 9410
 2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/prokofievs-romeo-juliet-w-the-sf-symphony-nov-
 13-15-3/
END:VEVENT
