CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Throwin’ Bo’s presents:\n\nBabehoven\n\nBabehoven is the H
 udson\, NY based project of singer-songwriter Maya Bon and collaborator Ry
 an Albert. Since 2017\, the band has carved out a sound that blends melodi
 c indie and folk rock with an occasional nod towards country. Bon serves a
 s the project’s principal songwriter and lyricist\, while Albert\, a mul
 ti-instrumentalist and producer\, further shapes the sonic world around he
 r songs. Together\, they’ve built a body of work that feels both intimat
 e and expansive.\n\n"Blue Around You\," Babehoven's new single\, is a coun
 try-flecked stomper. The song finds Bon singing with hard-won resilience: 
 "Yesterday a stranger told me they can see / That I feel levels of pain th
 at could've broken me / And I thought\, mmm but I survived it." Recorded a
 t The Chicken Shack and 12 Lb Genius in Upstate NY\, Maya and Ryan gathere
 d an excellent crew of musicians with producer Phil Weinrobe at the helm
 —Oliver Hill\, Zosha Warpeha\, Dylan Nowik\, Jared Samuel\, Ellington Pe
 et\, and Nick Kinsey. The core of the song was recorded live with no playb
 ack or headphones with the feel of the room being as much an instrument as
  the hardanger fiddle and harmonies that soar overhead.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n
 \nPileup\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nDOORS at 7:00PM | MUSIC at 8:00 PM\n\nTickets
 : https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2F
 1997427195511%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/
 2026/11/20/live-music-babehoven-pileup-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
