DESCRIPTION:Stay Out\n\nStay Out is a high-energy punk rock band from Oakl
 and\, California\, rooted deep in the East Bay DIY scene and driven by a r
 elentless commitment to authenticity\, connection\, and explosive live per
 formance. Formed in the summer of 2016 by Grant Pack and Mason McGeorge\, 
 the band quickly established itself as a force in underground punk- blendi
 ng raw\, aggressive energy with undeniably catchy hooks and melodic sensib
 ility.\n\nFronted by the dual-vocal attack of Pack and McGeorge\, Stay Out
  delivers a dynamic balance of grit and charisma\, pairing blistering riff
 s with anthemic choruses that hit just as hard in a packed venue as they d
 o through speakers. The lineup was solidified in 2018 with the addition of
  drummer Nate Reynoso\, whose impact on the band’s songwriting and sound
  helped push their evolution into something sharper\, louder\, and more co
 hesive.\n\nDrawing from the legacy of Bay Area punk while carving out thei
 r own lane\, Stay Out fuses high-octane punk rock with pop-punk accessibil
 ity\, creating music that’s both chaotic and emotionally resonant. Their
  lyrics tap into themes of defiance\, isolation\, struggle\, and social te
 nsion—reflecting real experiences while maintaining an undercurrent of r
 esilience and unity. Known for their wild\, unpredictable live shows and D
 IY ethos\, Stay Out has built their reputation from the ground up—handli
 ng everything from recording and production to booking\, merch\, and promo
 tion independently.\n\nThat hands-on approach has earned them a loya...\n\
 nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20348?siteToken=d2at
 bcege5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/28/li
 ve-music-stay-out-east-brothers-try-harder-tickets-rmzwwzk\nSource: DoTheB
 ay
