DESCRIPTION:TRASH & TREASURES presents:\n\nBEGOTTEN\n\nWhen it debuted in 
 1989\, E. Elias Merhige’s Begotten fascinated and shocked those who witn
 essed it. Never before had the screen depicted such a primal\, existential
  drama\, and it became one of the must-see films of the 1990s. The interve
 ning decades have not diminished the power of this unique motion picture e
 xperience. This new 4K restoration reveals the full photographic body of B
 egotten\, preserving its otherworldly organic texture and retaining its vi
 sceral impact\, a previously unknown life form captured in cinematic amber
 .\n\nDOORS & DJ SET at 7:00 PM | FILM at 7:30 PM\n\nOpening DJ Set from To
 pazu\, host of Sutro FM’s Celluloid Mixtape\, which recently hosted a Be
 gotten-inspired guest mix from Trash & Treasures host Andrew Sainz.\n\nTic
 kets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20283?siteToken=d2atbceg
 e5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/29/begott
 en-tickets-708yy98\nSource: DoTheBay
