DESCRIPTION:Magician and Mentalist Robert Goleman Brings "The Joy of Aston
 ishment" to The Lost Church Theatre in San Francisco on Thursday\, Decembe
 r 3\, at 8:15 PM.\nWith more than 50 years of stage experience\, Robert Go
 leman\ninvites audiences into a riveting\, intimate evening of magic and m
 entalism that\nhas been described as “nothing short of astonishing.” B
 lending suspense\, humor\,\nand audience connection\, his performance turn
 s every demonstration into a\npersonal encounter – one that feels imposs
 ible\, unforgettable\, and beyond\nexplanation.\nThe Joy of Astonishment i
 s more than a magic show—it\nis a shared experience of wonder\, created 
 for an intimate theatrical setting\nwhere every reaction becomes part of t
 he performance. Though Goleman has been\nabsent from social media for more
  than a decade\, he can only be seen live and\nin person—and should not 
 be missed. His reputation continues to grow through captivating\nlive appe
 arances and enthusiastic word of mouth\, a reminder that the most\npowerfu
 l promotion is the excitement audiences carry with them long after they\nl
 eave the theater.\nFor theatergoers drawn to wit\, wonder\, and the thrill
  of the\nimpossible\, Robert Goleman offers an intimate evening where warm
 th\, intellect\,\nand astonishment meet – only at The Lost Church. ALL A
 GES\, 10+ preferred.\n$30 General Admission. Show from 8:15-10:00pm. Doors
  open at\n7:30pm. Tickets at: https://thelostchurch.org/san-francisco/\nLo
 st Church\, 988 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\n(at the corner
  of Chestnut...\n\n$30 All Ages (10+ preferred)\nGoleman Magic\nListed tim
 e is doors\n\nTickets: https://thelostchurch.org/san-francisco/\nDetails: 
 https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/3/the-joy-of-astonishment-tickets\nSou
 rce: DoTheBay
