DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerBaukunst First Fridays: Art\, 
 Music + Food (Bernal Heights)\nBaukunst\nJoin us for Baukunst First Friday
 s\, our brand-new monthly celebration blending art\, music\, and food! Eve
 ry month\, experience a vibrant evening of creativity\, delicious bites\, 
 and fantastic tunes.\nMark your calendars and bring your friends — let
 ’s make every first Friday unforgettable!\n\nBaukunst First Fridays is a
 n art showcase dedicated to celebrating exceptional creative talent in SF 
 and beyond. While hosted by Baukunst\, the event transcends traditional ga
 lleries and commercial interests— we don’t take commission or profit i
 n any way. Instead\, we are guided by our desire to foster a high bar of a
 rtistic integrity and community engagement in the Bernal Heights neighborh
 ood.\n\nUpcoming Baukunst First Fridays: Art\, Music + Food (Bernal Height
 s) Events\nFri 11/6 Baukunst First Fridays: Art\, Music + Food (Bernal Hei
 ghts)Fri 12/4 Baukunst First Fridays: Art\, Music + Food (Bernal Heights)D
