DESCRIPTION:PlayGroundPlayGround closes out the summer season with the ina
 ugural Twisted Holiday Festival\, December 4th – December 20th\, 2026\, 
 at Potrero Stage and simulcast. This three-week “fringe style” new wor
 ks festival features 8 productions and 24 performances of new holiday-them
 ed works (with a twist!) by talented theatre artists from across the count
 ry including a variety PlayGround artists. Ranging in subjects from “Nau
 ghty” to “Nice”\, and scaled from ensemble plays to one-person shows
 \, PlayGround’s Twisted Holiday Festival features a stellar lineup of se
 asoned theatre professionals\, first-time producers\, and all-star perform
 ers in every aspect of live performance\, direction\, and choreography.\nP
 roductions will be presented for 3 performances at Potrero Stage (18th Str
 eet @ Arkansas). Admission is free (donations gratefully accepted) the day
  of performances for in-person attendance and all online viewing (live sim
 ulcast as well as on-demand)\; a minimal $10 donation is requested for adv
 ance in-person reservations. For more information or to reserve in-person 
 or online tickets\, visit https://playground-sf.org/twistedholiday\n\nFree
 \n\nTickets: https://playground-sf.org/twistedholiday\nDetails: https://sf
 .funcheap.com/2026-twisted-holiday-festival-24-theater-performances-sf-dec
 -420/\nSource: Funcheap SF
