BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LIVE MUSIC: Stephen Steinbrink\, April Magazine\, ersa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261206T220000
DTSTAMP:20261104T195100Z
UID:dothebay-17989155@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Stephen Steinbrink\n\n(Record Release Show)\n\nStephen Steinbr
 ink (b. 1988) is a songwriter\, producer\, and visual artist. Immersing hi
 mself in the West Coast underground DIY community in the mid-2000s\, Stein
 brink left on his first tour at the age of sixteen and continued performin
 g internationally for a decade\, living an improvised existence and record
 ing incessantly. He has released nine critically acclaimed albums of exper
 imental pop music and has collaborated as a producer and session player wi
 th artists including Boy Scouts/Taylor Vick\, Dear Nora\, Gia Margaret\, L
 AKE\, and Girlpool.\n\nThough appearing luminous and graceful on the surfa
 ce\, his songs use the recognizable logic of pop structures as a container
  for psychic inquiry\, revealing the unstable landscapes of memory\, dream
 s\, and the quotidian absurdities of daily life. Over two decades\, Steinb
 rink has become one of the most distinctive songwriters on the U.S. West C
 oast\, with a rarely matched gift for poetic imagery carried by a musical 
 language that moves across folk\, experimental pop\, and ambient experimen
 tation.\n\nIn visual art\, Steinbrink works in illustration\, photography\
 , animation\, and Stained Glass conservation\, having restored historic ar
 t glass throughout Northern California. He currently lives and works in Oa
 kland\, California.\n\nBandcamp | IG\n\nApril Magazine\n\nApril Magazine c
 ombines the talents of a handful of Bay Area indie pop notables into a col
 lective that releases fragile and noisy songs that land right in the...\n\
 nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20296?siteToken=d2at
 bcege5knqsavntt91g1250\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/liv
 e-music-stephen-steinbrink-april-magazine-ersa-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.782364;-122.482951
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/35142153/431c7c5a-65a2-4541-bf2d-5fce13eec9f4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T195100Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/6/live-music-stephen-steinbrink-ap
 ril-magazine-ersa-tickets
END:VEVENT
