BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LIVE MUSIC: Storefront Church
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T220000
DTSTAMP:20261104T195100Z
UID:dothebay-17923401@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Throwin’ Bo’s presents:\n\nStorefront Church\n\nStorefront
  Church is the project of Lukas Frank\, who's drummed in Phoebe Bridgers' 
 band and appeared on her albums\, and the first song of his debut album As
  We Pass features DIIV frontman Cole Smith\, but neither of those affiliat
 ions really prepares you for what to expect from As We Pass. It's a 9-song
  collection that's largely made up of bluesy\, gothy\, emo-y melancholic s
 ongs that sometimes sound like a cross between '90s Cure deep cuts and Nir
 vana Unplugged. (Lukas also cites Scott Walker as an influence\, and you c
 an hear that too.) Most of the album is bare-bones and somber\, but Lukas 
 also revs things up for the noise punk of "Faction from Under the Grove\,"
  and that fits right in too. With As We Pass\, Lukas enters a long\, line 
 of depressive singer/songwriters\, but even with over half a century of mu
 sic like this\, something about Lukas stands out. He grips you right off t
 he bat with album opener "After the Alphabets" -- the kind of song that ca
 n make you drop everything and listen as soon as his voice comes in -- and
  the album stays that compelling throughout. Even with connections to esta
 blished artists and the great Sargent House label behind him\, this doesn'
 t feel like the smash arrival of a hot new buzz artist\; it's the subtle a
 rrival of a songwriter whose songs creep up on you and knock you out when 
 you're least expecting it. Usually\, that's even better.\n\nBandcamp | IG\
 n\nSupport to be announced.\n\nDOORS at 7:00PM | MUSIC at 8:0...\n\nTicket
 s: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.eventbrite.com%2Fe%2
 F2002223480328%3Faff%3Doddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events
 /2026/12/10/live-music-storefront-church-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.782364;-122.482951
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34801584/738b061c-1c1a-4fdb-a77f-cec33e98eab0.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261104T195100Z
LOCATION:4 Star Theater\, 2200 Clement St\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94121
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/12/10/live-music-storefront-church-ti
 ckets
END:VEVENT
