DESCRIPTION:US Tour - 2 venues\n\nThe winner of four 2024 Tony Awards®\, 
 including Best Musical.\n\nAdapted from S.E. Hinton’s seminal novel and 
 Francis Ford Coppola’s iconic film\, this thrilling new musical features
  a book by Adam Rapp with Justin Levine\, music and lyrics by Jamestown Re
 vival (Jonathan Clay & Zach Chance) and Justin Levine\, music supervision\
 , orchestration\, and arrangements by Justin Levine\, choreography by Rick
  Kuperman & Jeff Kuperman\, and direction by Tony Award® winner Danya Tay
 mor. Entertainment Weekly says\, "It has the power to inspire an entire ge
 neration."\n\nOrpheum Theatre\n\nWed\, Dec 9 - Sun\, Dec 27\, 2026\n\nSaen
 ger Theatre\n\nTue\, Mar 30 - Sun\, Apr 4\, 2027\n\nTickets: https://us.at
 gtickets.com/events/the-outsiders/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2
 026/12/12/the-outsiders-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
