SUMMARY:Balboa Christmas Halloween Mystery Marathon ~ First Film
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261219T183000
DTSTAMP:20261103T193658Z
UID:dothebay-18017447@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Theatre & Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Due to forces beyond our control\, we are no longer able to ru
 n the Balboa Halloween Mystery Marathon on Halloween night. In the circums
 tance\, we are hard pivoting to the Balboa Christmas Halloween Mystery Mar
 athon. Same exact run of show\, same exact films selected. Only with more 
 holiday vibes.\n\nThis year\, the Balboa invites you to the BALBOA CHRISTM
 AS HALLOWEEN MOVIE MARATHON.\n\nJoin us any time that evening for the low\
 , low price of $13 as four different programmer select one of their favori
 te horror gems and we run them back to back throughout the night. You won
 ’t know what we’re playing until it’s being announced in the theater
 \, but we can guarantee that all of the films are (a) pre-20th century\, (
 b) never screened in the Bay Area (at least in the past five years)\, and 
 (c) have one curator on our team who think it’s sick as hell. Along with
  that\, we’ll have hot chocolate\, candy canes and special prizes for a 
 mid-way point costume contest for anyone who wants to dress up! Whether yo
 u join for one or stay for all\, come with friends or alone\, we guarantee
  your Saturday at the Balboa will be a night of pure\, sugar high\, blood 
 soaked movie adrenaline.\n\n4:30 PM: Mystery Movie #1 (1979) (4:30 PM - 6 
 PM)\n\n6:10 PM: Mystery Movie #2 (1984) (6:05 PM - 7:30 PM)\n\nCostume Con
 test/Intermission (Fifteen Minutes)\n\n7:40 PM: Mystery Movie #3 (1988) (7
 :45 - 9:11 PM)\n\n9:15 PM: Mystery Movie #4 (1986) (9:15 PM - 10:38 PM)\n\
 n$13\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/20344?siteTok
 en=52wkfzmjpwjjfpz3ye7tz8wscg\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/1
 2/19/balboa-christmas-halloween-mystery-marathon-first-film-tickets\nSourc
 e: DoTheBay
