DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event Organizer16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out
  a mic)\nPhoto: Chalkvisions Nikolas Larson\nTime: 9pm to 12am\, Every Thu
 rsday\nCelebrating 20 years in May 2023 (currently 19 years strong).\nInst
 agram: @16thmission.\nFor 18 years\, this outdoor “open mic-without-a-mi
 c” has welcomed poets\, musicians\, emcees\, comedy\, and everything in 
 between. In the best of San Francisco tradition\, everyone is welcome\, al
 l forms of expression\, in any language.\n\nOn the southwest streetcorner 
 by the BART station\, amidst the pigeons\, under the stars.\nSupport your 
 local streetcorner\, and come scream at the void with us!\n\nUpcoming 16th
  & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic) Events\nThu 11/5 16th & Mission Open Mic
  (w/out a mic)Thu 11/12 16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic)Thu 11/19 16t
 h & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic)Thu 11/26 16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out
  a mic)Thu 12/3 16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic)Thu 12/10 16th & Miss
 ion Open Mic (w/out a mic)Thu 12/17 16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic)T
 hu 12/24 16th & Mission Open Mic (w/out a mic)Disclaimer: Please double ch
 eck event information with the event organizer as events can be canceled\,
  details can change after they are added to our calendar\, and errors do o
 ccur.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.facebook.com/groups/103422546416088\
 nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/16th-mission-open-mic-w-out-a-mic-270/\n
 Source: Funcheap SF
